# The meadow ring (MeadowView, 18_meadow): over the shoulder, the player
# knee-deep in the coast's sward as a gust front crosses it, and what it costs.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/foliage_meadow_ring.tour --seed=7 [--quality=ultra|high|medium|low]
# Web proxy: godot --path . --rendering-method gl_compatibility -- --tour=tours/foliage_meadow_ring.tour --seed=7 --quality=web
# `near meadow` (18_trample) stands the player in the widest level sward near
# the coast's spawn, and a few steps take them out from beside a bush. A full
# held wind carries a front about 6 tiles a second, so 01-03, 0.6 s apart,
# watch one come through the grass round the player.
# `perf meadow` then prints the frame with the ring and without it, and
# `perf sward` with all the grass and none: the tier's cost at eye level.
weather clear:0:wind=1
hour 16
coast calm
place coast
near meadow
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 10
await meadow 15
walk 0,-1 1.2
wait 2.0
shot 01-knee-deep-in-the-meadow with land:coast,meadow
wait 0.6
shot 02-a-front-crossing-0.6s-on with land:coast,meadow
wait 0.6
shot 03-a-front-crossing-1.2s-on with land:coast,meadow
walk 0,-1 1.5
shot 04-walked-through-it with land:coast,meadow
perf meadow 6.0
perf sward 6.0
perf noise 6.0
release shoulder_peek
weather rules
